Dialogue: 99,0:00:00.69,0:00:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsuda, la urechile mele a ajuns faptul că \Nți-ai cumpărat un robot sexual. E adevărat?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.94,0:00:05.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamnă director, eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.26,0:00:08.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spune-mi că nu ești un \Nastfel de criminal, Tsuda.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stați, nu este așa...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.37,0:00:12.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E în regulă, stăpână.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:12.59,0:00:15.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vom putea fi împreună pe vecie acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.08,0:00:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.67,0:00:23.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fost doar un vis.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:26.65,0:00:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uite cât de liniștită doarme.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.80,0:00:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stai, dar roboții nu dorm.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.53,0:00:36.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-a stricat?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate a rămas fără baterie?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.36,0:00:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A stat {\i1}pornită{\i0} încă \Nde când a ajuns aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.11,0:00:46.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun, ar trebui să fie în regulă acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.67,0:00:52.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stai, unde e butonul de pornire?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm... Poate e pe spate?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.67,0:00:59.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În față?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.54,0:01:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar o aluniță.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.07,0:01:06.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, mă simt ca o \Nadevărată perversă acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.78,0:01:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu o pot lăsa așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.92,0:01:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un cod QR!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:18.26,0:01:19.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate voi găsi niște informatii.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.07,0:01:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vă mulțumim pentru achiziție!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.59,0:01:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acest video vă va învăța tot ce trebuie să știți \Ndespre androidul vostru sexual, Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.58,0:01:31.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Să vedem cum o pornim.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.55,0:01:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oare chiar vreau s-o pornesc înapoi?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.69,0:01:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu vreau s-o arunc,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.24,0:01:43.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}dar poate ar fi mai \Nbine s-o las oprită.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.23,0:01:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, așa e, uitasem \Ncă am comandat asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.81,0:01:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.81,0:01:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pentru a o porni, \Nsărutați-o franțuzesc
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.44,0:01:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}și apăsați ușor butonul din gura ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.52,0:02:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unde este? Unde este butonul?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.76,0:02:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpână?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-ai trezit!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.56,0:02:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te mai trezeai, deci îmi făceam \Ngriji că te-ai fi putut strica.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.23,0:02:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ușurare.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.18,0:02:23.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am uitat complet \Nsă-mi reîncarc bateria.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.01,0:02:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E în regulă. Și eu ar fi \Ntrebuit să mă gândesc la asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar, mai întâi, uite.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine... Stăpână? Ce e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.71,0:02:34.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aveam doar uniforma mea școlară care să ți \Nse potrivească, așa că ți-am cumpărat asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă așteptam să \Narate precum o costumație.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.69,0:02:39.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar îți vine minunat.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.84,0:02:41.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești așa adorabilă, Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.60,0:02:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tocmai mi-ai spus pe nume?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.17,0:02:48.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai mai făcut asta până acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.69,0:02:51.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt așa de fericită.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.05,0:02:53.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog să-mi spui pe \Nnume în continuare.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.99,0:02:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh. Oh, nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.10,0:02:57.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E așa de drăguță.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.72,0:03:02.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De acum înainte, voi intra în \Nmodul somn odată cu tine, stăpână.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.74,0:03:03.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.93,0:03:08.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă poți trezi în același \Nmod în care m-ai repornit.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.06,0:03:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În modul în care te-am repornit?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.20,0:03:12.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E o limitare funcțională deoarece \Nnu ești înregistrată ca stăpân.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.23,0:03:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă erai, trebuia \Ndoar să-mi spui numele.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.21,0:03:21.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci te poți înregistra ca stăpâna mea sau \Nmă poți trezi manual în fiecare dimineață.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.50,0:03:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe care variantă o preferi?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe niciuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:16.76,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Înregistrat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:15.76,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko!
